{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"For any two expressions $A$ and $B$,\n\n\u003eif $A\\cdot B=0$ then either $A=0$ or $B=0$.\n\nThis is called the *zero product property*.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In our case, $(x -7)(-4x -2)=0$. So either $(x -7)=0$ or $(-4x -2)=0$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n(1)\u0026\u0026x -7\u0026=0\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\u0026x\u0026=7\n\\end{align}$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n(2)\u0026\u0026-4x -2\u0026=0\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\u0026-4x \u0026= 2\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\u0026x\u0026=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\text{lesser }x \u0026= -\\dfrac{1}{2}\n\\\\\\\\\n\\text{greater } x \u0026= 7\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Solve for $x$.**  \n*Enter the solutions from least to greatest.*\n\n$(x -7)(-4x -2)=0$\n\n$\\text{lesser }x = $ [[☃ numeric-input 1]]\n\n$\\text{greater } x = $ [[☃ numeric-input 2]]","images":{},"widgets":{"numeric-input 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answers":[{"answerForms":["proper","improper"],"maxError":0,"message":"","simplify":"required","status":"correct","strict":false,"value":-0.5}],"coefficient":false,"labelText":"least x","multipleNumberInput":false,"rightAlign":false,"size":"small","static":false},"static":false,"type":"numeric-input","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}},"numeric-input 2":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answers":[{"maxError":0,"message":"","simplify":"required","status":"correct","strict":false,"value":7}],"coefficient":false,"labelText":"greatest x","multipleNumberInput":false,"rightAlign":false,"size":"small","static":false},"static":false,"type":"numeric-input","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
